{'analyzerId': 'prebuilt-layout', 'apiVersion': '2025-11-01', 'createdAt': '2026-10-07T16:26:02Z', 'stringEncoding': 'codePoint', 'warnings': [], 'contents': [{'path': 'input1', 'markdown': '# Corporate Data Platform Cost Analysis Report\n\nReporting period: September 2026\n\nEnvironment: Production\n\nApplication: Customer Analytics Data Platform\n\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nTotal production cost for September was $99,900, representing an 18% increase compared with August. Compute\nis the largest cost category. The primary contributor to the increase was higher batch-processing workload.\n\n\n## Monthly Cost Breakdown\n\n\n<table>\n<tr>\n<th>Cost Category</th>\n<th>September Cost</th>\n<th>Change vs August</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Compute</td>\n<td>$42,500</td>\n<td>+22%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Storage</td>\n<td>$18,200</td>\n<td>+8%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Data Processing</td>\n<td>$31,800</td>\n<td>+21%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Network / Egress</td>\n<td>$7,400</td>\n<td>+5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Total</td>\n<td>$99,900</td>\n<td>+18%</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n\n## Workload Cost Details\n\n\n<table>\n<tr>\n<th>Workload</th>\n<th>Compute</th>\n<th>Storage</th>\n<th>Processing</th>\n<th>Total</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Customer Analytics</td>\n<td>$18,000</td>\n<td>$7,200</td>\n<td>$12,500</td>\n<td>$37,700</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ETL / Batch Processing</td>\n<td>$15,500</td>\n<td>$5,800</td>\n<td>$14,800</td>\n<td>$36,100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Reporting Platform</td>\n<td>$5,000</td>\n<td>$3,900</td>\n<td>$2,800</td>\n<td>$11,700</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Data Ingestion</td>\n<td>$4,000</td>\n<td>$1,300</td>\n<td>$1,700</td>\n<td>$7,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Other</td>\n<td>$0</td>\n<td>$0</td>\n<td>$0</td>\n<td>$7,400</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n\n\n## Top Cost Drivers\n\n. Compute represents the largest cost category at $42,500.\n\n. ETL / Batch Processing increased significantly because of higher processing volume.\n\n. Customer Analytics remains the largest individual workload by total cost.\n\n. Network / Egress remains comparatively small but should be monitored for growth.\n\n\n## Optimization Recommendations\n\n. Review batch-processing schedules and eliminate unnecessary repeated workloads.\n\n. Evaluate compute sizing for workloads with consistently low utilization.\n\n. Review storage retention policies for older analytical data.\n\n. Investigate opportunities to reduce repeated data movement and network egress.\n', 'kind': 'document', 'startPageNumber': 1, 'endPageNumber': 1, 'unit': 'inch', 'pages': [{'pageNumber': 1, 'angle': 0, 'width': 8.2639, 'height': 11.6806, 'spans': [{'offset': 0, 'length': 2141}], 'words': [{'content': 'Corporate', 'span': {'offset': 2, 'length': 9}, 'confidence': 0.998, 'source': 'D(1,1.384,0.8278,2.5674,0.8274,2.5674,1.101,1.384,1.0988)'}, {'content': 'Data', 'span': {'offset': 12, 'length': 4}, 'confidence': 0.998, 'source': 'D(1,2.6499,0.8274,3.182,0.8272,3.182,1.1022,2.6499,1.1012)'}, {'content': 'Platform', 'span': {'offset': 17, 'length': 8}, 'confidence': 0.996, 'source': 'D(1,3.2691,0.8272,4.2598,0.8272,4.2598,1.1035,3.2691,1.1023)'}, {'content': 'Cost', 'span': {'offset': 26, 'length': 4}, 'confidence': 0.997, 'source': 'D(1,4.3424,0.8272,4.8974,0.8272,4.8973,1.1043,4.3424,1.1036)'}, {'content': 'Analysis', 'span': {'offset': 31, 'length': 8}, 'confidence': 0.994, 'source': 'D(1,4.9524,0.8272,5.9844,0.8276,5.9844,1.1051,4.9524,1.1044)'}, {'content': 'Report', 'span': {'offset': 40, 'length': 6}, 'confidence': 0.997, 'source': 'D(1,6.0623,0.8276,6.8879,0.8279,6.8879,1.1057,6.0623,1.1052)'}, {'content': 'Reporting', 'span': {'offset': 48, 'length': 9}, 'confidence': 0.997, 'source': 'D(1,0.7778,1.2737,1.3506,1.2711,1.3514,1.4394,0.7788,1.4412)'}, {'content': 'period', 'span': {'offset': 58, 'length': 6}, 'confidence': 0.997, 'source': 'D(1,1.3924,1.2709,1.7511,1.2696,1.7516,1.4377,1.3931,1.4392)'}, {'content': ':', 'span': {'offset': 64, 'length': 1}, 'confidence': 0.999, 'source': 'D(1,1.7622,1